#: about/konq_aboutpage.cpp:311
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When you want to paste a new address into the Location toolbar you might "
"want to clear the current entry by pressing the black arrow with the white "
"cross <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\"></img> in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Cuando quieras apegar una nueva direición dientro de la barra de direiciones "
"tienes de llimpiar la entrada actual calcando na flecha negra cola cruz "
"blanca <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\"></img> na barra de "
"ferramientes."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cpp:315
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "To create a link on your desktop pointing to the current page, simply "
#| "drag the \"Location\" label that is to the left of the Location toolbar, "
#| "drop it on to the desktop, and choose \"Link\"."
msgid ""
"To create a link on your desktop pointing to the current page, simply drag "
"the icon (favicon) that is to the left of the Location toolbar, drop it on "
"to the desktop, and choose \"Icon\"."
msgstr ""
"Pa crear un enllaz nel to escritoriu qu'apunte a la páxina actual, arrastra "
"la etiqueta de «Allugamientu» que ta a la esquierda de la barra "
"dállugamientu, suéltala nel escritoriu, y escueyi «Enllazar»."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cpp:318
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You can also find <img width='16' height='16' src=\"%1\" /> \"Full-Screen "
"Mode\" in the Settings menu. This feature is very useful for \"Talk\" "
"sessions."
